Why non-commercial: YuE2Kit is a Swift port of the ahmadw/YuE2-3B-MLX inference code, which is released under
CC BY-NC 4.0, and it runs the m-a-p/YuE2-3B and YuE2-Vae weights, which are also CC BY-NC 4.0. Those terms apply
to the weights and to audio you generate with them.

Third-party components:
- tools/vendor/abc_tools.py: from the upstream yue2-music skill, Apache License 2.0.
- mlx-swift (fetched by Swift Package Manager): MIT, Copyright Apple Inc.
